        "eyebrow": "Product Overview",
        "title": "The most approachable way to begin.",
        "text": "The Sensol FLEX AIR is the most approachable way to enter the world of reformer Pilates and smart strength training. Designed for beginners, apartment dwellers, and anyone curious about Pilates, the FLEX AIR delivers the core Sensol experience at a fraction of the cost. With dual-level spring resistance up to 120 kg max load, a foldable frame, and the Vesta Sensol App's 300+ guided classes, it's the smartest first step toward a stronger, more balanced body."
      }
    },
