        "eyebrow": "Key Feature 01",
        "title": "Most Affordable Quality Reformer in Australia",
        "text_1": "At just $650 AUD, the FLEX AIR is less than a quarter of the price of the Your Reformer ($2,795) and roughly half the cost of the Align-Pilates F3 Folding ($1,999). Unlike ultra-budget options that use basic springs and lack app connectivity, the FLEX AIR delivers a complete ecosystem: precision resistance, smart app integration, and professional-grade build quality.",
        "text_2": "It's the only product in this price range that combines reformer functionality with strength training and digital coaching. No other reformer under $1,000 in Australia offers app-connected training, 300+ guided classes, and a dual-function Pilates-plus-strength design."
      }
    },
