        "eyebrow": "Key Feature 02",
        "title": "Foldable, Compact, and Apartment-Friendly",
        "text_1": "The FLEX AIR is the only Sensol model with a foldable frame, collapsing from 185 cm to 165 cm in length. Store it upright against a wall or slide it under a bed — its 13 cm ground clearance keeps it stable during use while maintaining a low profile. At just 25 kg, it's light enough for one person to move and reposition.",
        "text_2": "The 0.2 m² upright storage footprint means it fits in any room, from a studio apartment in Melbourne's CBD to a spare corner in a Sydney terrace. Traditional wooden reformers require dedicated floor space and are difficult to move. The FLEX AIR folds and stores in seconds."
      }
    },
