        "title": "Smooth Spring Resistance for Gentle Progression",
        "text_1": "The dual-level spring system (10 lb × 2 and 20 lb × 2) delivers smooth, continuous tension that's ideal for beginners learning proper form. Unlike spring-based systems that can feel jerky or overwhelming, springs provide a gentler onset of resistance that reduces the risk of strain or injury.",
        "text_2": "With a maximum load capacity of 120 kg, a stable 84 cm stroke, and spring resistance via Chinese steel wire springs (7.5KG × 2 / 15KG × 2), the FLEX AIR supports everything from gentle rehabilitation movements to moderately challenging strength exercises. Three training modes — Standard, Off-centre, and Constant — further expand your options."
      }
