        "text_1": "Every FLEX AIR includes free access to the Vesta Sensol App (iOS and Android), featuring over 300 guided classes spanning Pilates, yoga, strength training, and rehabilitation. Structured programmes guide absolute beginners through to intermediate practitioners, with new classes added regularly.",
        "text_2": "Wi-Fi and Bluetooth connectivity ensure seamless syncing. NordicTrack's iFIT costs $34/month. Frame Fitness charges $39.99/month. The Vesta Sensol App is included free — saving you up to $480 per year in subscription fees. No monthly fees, no locked content, no usage limits."
